WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.200
Found a supplier?

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.100
Before you send any money,
commission us to verify them.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.800
We check company registration,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.400
mining and export licences
and authority to sell,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.030
on the ground, not from a desk.
